 result←object Push arg;cbits
 cbits←object._pic ##.##.∆WG'CBits' ⍝ The Bitmap child will always exist
 :If ×≢arg←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Push'##.##.Error~##.##.IsNum arg
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: Push'##.##.Error 1≠≢⍴arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Push'##.##.Error 4≠≢arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Push'##.##.Error∨/arg<0
     arg←⌊0.5+arg×4⍴⊃##._supp.MyUnits object ⍝ Convert scaled arg to whole pixels
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Push'##.##.Error∨/cbits⍴⍛<+⌿2 2⍴arg
     cbits←arg[3 4]↑arg[1 2]↓cbits
 :EndIf
 object._push_image←cbits ⍝ Keep in ⊥RGB-form
 result←##.NoRes
